  "title": "Sicilian Anchovy Pasta",
  "description": "Anchovy pasta made with spaghetti tossed in hot garlic oil with anchovies. Top with bread crumbs, parsley, and Parmesan for a sensational Sicilian meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Simon"
  ],
